-#
-#  Sub-items of the "Finanzen" main-nav section. Zahlungsverkehr (accounts /
-#  person fees / payment plans) is the default; Moss holds the Moss overview /
-#  card transactions; Buchhaltung holds the DATEV bookkeeping / bookings;
-#  Abstimmung matches accounting entries with bookings.
-#  See doc/navigation.md for how nav / sheets / tabs fit together.
%ul.nav-left-list
  = nav t("fin.nav.payments"), wsjrdp_fin_accounts_path, %w[fin], %w[fin/moss bookkeeping bookings reconciliation]
  = nav t("fin.nav.moss"), moss_path, %w[fin/moss]
  = nav t("fin.nav.accounting"), bookkeeping_path, %w[bookkeeping bookings]
  = nav t("fin.nav.reconciliation"), reconciliation_path, %w[reconciliation]
